Toner portable mode.
While this file is next to Toner.exe, Toner keeps its database, settings, logs, session logs, saved host keys and downloaded
updates in the "data" folder beside it, so the whole folder can be copied to a USB drive or another computer.
Passwords stay in Windows Credential Manager on each computer and do not travel with the folder.
Delete this file to make Toner use %APPDATA%\NetCheck again.
